        <a href="/services/" class="btn btn-outline" style="color:var(--white);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);">View All Services</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container" style="padding:3rem 1.5rem;">
    <div style="background:rgba(30,64,175,0.05);border-left:4px solid #FACC15;padding:1rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;">
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Local Maidstone drylining team covering Hollingbourne (ME17). CSCS-accredited, £1M insured, same-day quotes on all standard partition, ceiling, plasterboard and fire-rated work.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.875rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem;">About Hollingbourne</h2>
    <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Hollingbourne is a hillside village 5 miles east of Maidstone on the A20, sitting beneath the North Downs and adjacent to Hollingbourne Rural Park. Property stock is largely period cottages in the village core and 1960s/70s detached houses on the slopes leading up to the Downs.</p>
    <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our standard wet-trade coverage across Hollingbourne includes dot-and-dab plasterboarding, independent metal stud partitions, suspended ceiling grids, fire-rated column and beam encasements, and acoustic partitions to Part E. We work directly for homeowners, landlords, commercial tenants and main contractors, and we can usually be on-site in Hollingbourne within a week of acceptance.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.875rem;font-weight:700;margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">What We Do in Hollingbourne</h2>
    <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
      <li>Dot-and-dab plasterboarding (insulated + standard plasterboard)</li>
      <li>Metal stud partition walls (single + twin frame, acoustic infill)</li>
      <li>Suspended ceilings (grid + tile, MF plaster, exposed grid)</li>
      <li>Fire-rated plasterboard systems (30/60/90/120 minutes to BS 476)</li>
      <li>Acoustic partitions (Part E compliance, Robust Detail construction)</li>
      <li>Taping and jointing to finish standard</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.875rem;font-weight:700;margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Typical Property Types in Hollingbourne</h2>
    <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Period cottages, 1960s/70s detached houses, North Downs rural properties. Our Hollingbourne team is set up for quick site visits across all of them.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.875rem;font-weight:700;margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Nearby Areas</h2>
